#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:6 d108b2a6b0e64c9b8075e37d503adf73
msgid "SequreH743"
msgstr "SequreH743"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:7 9749d2acd610489b882ca854ab7ce973
msgid ""
"The SequreH743 and SequreH743v2 are flight controllers designed and produced"
" by `Sequre <https://sequremall.coms>`_."
msgstr ""
"SequreH743和SequreH743v2是由 `Sequre <https://sequremall.coms>`_ 设计和生产的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:10 da66f28cb10b4789928d545c76a74bad
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:11 b28b0e4158e64eabb8f2952acfc7d5d1
msgid "MCU - STM32H743xx 32-bit processor running at 480 MHz"
msgstr "MCU - STM32H743xx 32位处理器，运行频率480 MHz"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:12 1af1e85c4f914e709881aaa37c92f980
msgid "IMU - MPU6000, ICM42688 (V2 version)"
msgstr "IMU - MPU6000，ICM42688（V2版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:13 7f2df9bdc50740f69d3038e904581532
msgid "Barometer - BMP280 (DPS368 and DPS310 on V2)"
msgstr "气压计 - BMP280（V2版本为DPS368和DPS310）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:14 7514f27871c347d89bf1a3aebf9e73e6
msgid "OSD - AT7456E"
msgstr "OSD - AT7456E"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:15 fa9cd658b6f14ea58e0e4d82dbd51a25
msgid "6x UARTs"
msgstr "6路UART"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:16 7a98ba6a933246d398bd48486a84c260
msgid "9x PWM Outputs (8 Motor Output, 1 LED)"
msgstr "9路PWM输出（8路电机输出，1路LED）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:19 eb0ecc1dc6b042f9be25369ef1898d99
msgid "Pinout"
msgstr "引脚定义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:27 93565d8b4ea94084abf8ecbf7425cab6
msgid "UART Mapping"
msgstr "UART映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:28 9c5c7f24e6e0414c833b973a4cd626b6
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked Rn and Tn in the above pinouts. The Rn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The Tn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn."
msgstr "上述引脚图中 UART 标记为 Rn 和 Tn。Rn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，Tn 引脚为 UARTn 的发送引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:31 d8cdbf197c734347aafcb7962bac2fb6
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB (MAVLink2)"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB（MAVLink2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:32 199bfd7c8bb04c59beb3b3d87a41847b
msgid "SERIAL1 -> USART1 (RCIN, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> USART1（RCIN，DMA使能）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:33 77e7f37c8d2640508d27c6ed74085e9e
msgid "SERIAL2 -> USART2 (SmartAudio)"
msgstr "SERIAL2 -> USART2（SmartAudio）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:34 f637549841ee4049b1b90572160e753d
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (None)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（无）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:35 b22d5d119bbf4e149deab75678a062c7
msgid "SERIAL6 -> USART6 (GPS, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> USART6（GPS，DMA使能）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:36 ecde7bde82eb431c9db20eda460ada3f
msgid "SERIAL7 -> UART7 (DisplayPort, DMA-enabled)"
msgstr "SERIAL7 -> UART7（DisplayPort，DMA使能）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:37 35feae18677d4bfd9eb2baea9f738fda
msgid "SERIAL8 -> UART8 (ESCTelemetry)"
msgstr "SERIAL8 -> UART8（ESC数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:40 e8d2f70608424c5a8936828450ae6d5f
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:41 13cc5a19079c4c62b5090d3d29f6e8fc
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on USART1. RC could  be applied instead "
"to a different UART port such as  and set the protocol to receive RC data "
"``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` = 23 and change :ref:`SERIAL1 _PROTOCOL "
"<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'. For RC protocols other "
"than unidirectional, the USART1_TX pin will need to be used:"
msgstr ""
"默认RC输入配置在USART1上。RC输入也可改为接入其他UART端口，并将协议设置为接收RC数据 ``SERIALn_PROTOCOL`` = "
"23，同时将 :ref:`SERIAL1 _PROTOCOL <SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` "
"更改为非'23'的值。对于非单向协议的RC协议，需要使用USART1_TX引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:43 c4dfb65b34894e61b7612353dd19a9ec
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:44 4c33a3824a2649a8a55220c4cc70113a
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:45 164e3991387a455c9cdb27d11a7c2a14
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」，且仅连接TX引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:46 dd7f5575a6514ea7b8297bf5512f1b65
msgid "PPM is not supported"
msgstr "不支持PPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:49 dbbc921123ae46608f10a0a2fadb9bae
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:50 abd8543c452f4f1cbb5e4726f693e428
msgid ""
"The SequreH743 supports OSD using its MAX7456by default, and simultaneously "
"DisplayPort using UART7 on the HD VTX connector if "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` is set to \"5\"."
msgstr ""
"SequreH743默认支持使用其MAX7456进行OSD，如果将 :ref:`OSD_TYPE2<OSD_TYPE2>` "
"设置为「5」，同时支持通过HD VTX连接器上的UART7使用DisplayPort。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:53 68436148858c4abe8af9d6e709235981
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "VTX支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:54 f5cffc0b27194e9fb13b8b73eadb2c94
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a DJI Air Unit / HD VTX connection. Protocol"
" defaults to DisplayPort. Pin 1 of the connector is 9v so be careful not to "
"connect this to a peripheral that can not tolerate this voltage."
msgstr ""
"SH1.0-6P连接器支持DJI Air Unit/HD "
"VTX连接。协议默认为DisplayPort。连接器第1脚为9V，请注意不要将其连接到无法承受该电压的外设。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:57 45393004962f4fe5b4ca939269a2cc31
msgid "Camera control"
msgstr "相机控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:58 b9f41576ff8943d487dd1abc7a65d734
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 is a pin for PWM camera control (CC pad) which is not supported by "
"ArduPilot. It can be used as a general GPIO pin. By default RELAY2 is "
"configured to control this pin and sets the GPIO high."
msgstr ""
"GPIO "
"81是用于PWM相机控制（CC焊盘）的引脚，ArduPilot不支持该功能。可作为通用GPIO引脚使用。默认情况下，RELAY2配置为控制该引脚并将GPIO设为高电平。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:61 4ab16bffc4e34a29b43d02ab3882d19e
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:62 e641a68037944e5ab6c39ec38e35b79e
msgid ""
"The SequreH743 supports up to 9 PWM or DShot outputs. The pads for motor "
"output M1 to M9 are provided on both the motor connectors and on separate "
"pads, plus separate pad for LED strip (default configuration) or another PWM"
" output."
msgstr ""
"SequreH743支持最多9路PWM或DShot输出。电机输出M1至M9的焊盘同时在电机连接器和独立焊盘上提供，另有独立焊盘用于LED灯带（默认配置）或另一路PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:66 89e12c65d824411babd8eee693dd0cd2
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM分为4组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:69 eb3b0c4ca36d408cb4b24e308eab9a4e
msgid "PWM 1-4   in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-4   第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:70 30cdfb3ba9064b7bae3c5675f83c6d62
msgid "PWM 5-6   in group2"
msgstr "PWM 5-6   第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:71 c06b496ef5904b34a39ef8eab5b802dd
msgid "PWM 7-8   in group3"
msgstr "PWM 7-8   第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:72 de99745d9db64f5ea291cb9e7f9b3f78
msgid "PWM 9 (LED)   in group4"
msgstr "PWM 9（LED）   第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:74 ff552a7e061248a3902ded3a959b000c
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-8 support bi-directional dshot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率。如果某组中的任意通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。通道1-8支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:79 f5d0800184ad44a58ec0d620989e87d4
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:80 03ca170a13844c3a9e16e660b427059d
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:82 6cf1492b0901446aae824e4010ccde55
msgid ""
"The default battery parameters are: * :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4 "
"* :ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13 * "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12 (CURR pin) *"
" :ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17.2"
msgstr ""
"默认电池参数为：* :ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4 * "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13 * "
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 12（CURR引脚）* "
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.0 * "
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 17.2"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:90 2097d307f735463faf18cbe15a3a76a3
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:91 cfcf0ea615fb4a52a3cc1a5484484de4
msgid ""
"The SequreH743 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "SequreH743没有内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL焊盘使用I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:94 5c08703756fa41c6bc886cecb8d01787
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:95 5dc464ca08414dc495e934a63af19d18
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ in sub-folders labeled \"SequreH743\"."
msgstr ""
"这些飞控板的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"找到，位于标有「SequreH743」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:97 0b1193c6acd64f73bbf5a71876f66c65
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "初始固件加载可通过按住引导程序按钮插入USB以DFU方式完成。然后使用您喜欢的DFU加载工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sequreh743.rst:101
#: 514d01bb9bd34040ab3ef4a267e58e06
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj "
"firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可以使用任意 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
